        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9141, Vintage Collection Lorabelle Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis vintage-style knob emulates the classic elegance of days gone by. Few designs rival this knob's quiet nod to Victorian design while still maintaining modern quality that can only be expected of solid brass cabinet pulls. The 3 finishes only add to the old world styling of the Lorabelle Vintage Finish Cabinet Knob by mimicking the texture of naturally weathered metal.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available the <a href=\"/products/lorabelle-cabinet-knob-omnia-9141-30\"><b>Omnia 42914 Lorabelle Cabinet Knob</b></a> in other finishes and other <a href=\"/collections/omnia-cabinet-hardware\"><b>Omnia Vintage Collection Cabinet Knobs</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Simple Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
